 7. 🗺️ Lake America is live 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Screenshots of Google Maps and Apple Maps taken yesterday morning.

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 President Trump's order to rename Lake Ontario to "Lake America" is splitting digital map providers:

 Google Maps now says "Lake America." Apple Maps is sticking with Lake Ontario. MapQuest said : "We're not changing the name of Lake Ontario. Name it whatever you want at your leisure." Photo: Keito Newman/The Canadian Press via AP Above: Ontario Premier Doug Ford (right) unveiled this sign Saturday in Grimsby, Ontario, Canada.

